---
layout: base.njk
---
{% set total = directory.categories | totalLinks %}
<div class="portal">

  <aside class="col left">
    <section class="box">
      <h2 class="c-peach">What's NEW</h2>
      <div class="in"><ul>
        <li><a href="/directory/">{{ total }} checked AI tools</a> in {{ directory.categories | length }} categories <span class="new">NEW!</span></li>
        <li><b>Just added:</b></li>
        {% for cat in directory.categories | batch(6) | first %}{% set l = cat.links | last %}<li>&raquo; <a href="/tool/{{ l.slug }}/">{{ l.title }}</a> <span class="small">({{ cat.name }})</span></li>
        {% endfor %}
        <li><b>Oct 2026:</b> 123ofnet.com is back after 20 years! <a href="/1999/">See the original site</a></li>
      </ul></div>
    </section>
    {% for cat in directory.categories | batch(5) | first %}
    <section class="box">
      <h2 style="background:{{ cat.color }}">{{ cat.name }}</h2>
      <div class="in"><ul>
        {% for l in cat.links | batch(3) | first %}<li><a href="{{ l.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ l.title }}</a>: {{ l.note }}</li>{% endfor %}
      </ul>
      <p class="small"><a href="/directory/{{ cat.slug }}/">More {{ cat.name }} &raquo;</a></p></div>
    </section>
    {% endfor %}
  </aside>

  <div class="col center">
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>Find the right <em>AI tool</em> for anything</h1>
      <p>Thousands of AI tools launch every month. We check them and list the ones that work,
      sorted by what you want to get done.</p>
      <form action="/directory/" method="get" role="search">
        <label for="q2" class="sr">Search AI tools</label>
        <input id="q2" name="q" type="search" placeholder="e.g. write my resume, remove photo background" style="width:70%;padding:5px;border:2px inset #C0C0C0;font:15px Verdana,sans-serif">
        <button type="submit">Go</button>
      </form>
    </section>

    <section class="box">
      <h2 class="c-blue">Categories</h2>
      <div class="cats">
        {% for cat in directory.categories %}
        <div>
          <a class="cat" href="/directory/{{ cat.slug }}/">{{ cat.name }}</a> <span class="small">({{ cat.links | length }})</span><br>
          <span class="sub">{% for l in cat.links | batch(3) | first %}<a href="/directory/{{ cat.slug }}/">{{ l.title }}</a>{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}...</span>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="box">
      <h2 class="c-news">Free AI Tools from 123ofnet</h2>
      <div class="in" style="font-size:14px">
        <p>Just like we gave away free email and 20 MEGS of webspace in 2001, we're building free AI tools:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>&raquo; <b>AI Email Writer</b>: polite replies, complaints, follow-ups</li>
          <li>&raquo; <b>Resume &amp; Cover Letter Fixer</b></li>
          <li>&raquo; <b>eGreetings</b>: the perfect birthday or thank-you message</li>
          <li>&raquo; <b>Business Name Finder</b> with domain check</li>
          <li>&raquo; <b>Make A Website For Free Today</b>: your homepage in 60 seconds</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="center"><a class="btn" href="/tools/">See the free tools &raquo;</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <aside class="col right">
    <section class="box">
      <h2 class="c-green">Newsletter</h2>
      <div class="in center">
        <p><b>Join the {{ site.newsletter.name }}</b><br>5 AI tools that actually work, every week. Free.</p>
        {% include "newsletter.njk" %}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="box">
      <h2 class="c-lemon">Made an AI tool?</h2>
      <div class="in center">
        <p>Get it in front of people looking for it.</p>
        <p><b>Fast Track</b> {{ site.prices.fastTrack }}<br>Listed within 48 hours</p>
        <p><b>Featured</b> {{ site.prices.featured }}<br>Top of your category + homepage</p>
        <p><a class="btn hot" href="/submit/">Get Listed &raquo;</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="box">
      <h2 class="c-lilac">Need help with AI?</h2>
      <div class="in center">
        <p>We set up AI for small businesses: tools, workflows, and getting <b>ChatGPT &amp; friends to recommend you</b>.</p>
        <p><a href="/advertise/#setup">Learn more &raquo;</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    {% for cat in directory.categories | batch(5) | last %}
    <section class="box">
      <h2 style="background:{{ cat.color }}">{{ cat.name }}</h2>
      <div class="in"><ul>
        {% for l in cat.links | batch(2) | first %}<li><a href="{{ l.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ l.title }}</a>: {{ l.note }}</li>{% endfor %}
      </ul><p class="small"><a href="/directory/{{ cat.slug }}/">More &raquo;</a></p></div>
    </section>
    {% endfor %}
  </aside>
</div>
